OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPerhaps some early brightness,
OL,6,Fbut cloud soon thickening ahead of
OL,7,Frain moving northeastwards from mid-
OL,8,Fmorning. Occasionally heavy rain
OL,9,Faround lunchtime will ease somewhat
OL,10,Fduring the afternoon. Winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening again, with strong and
OL,12,Fgusty winds by late afternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA damp evening, with
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain. A spell of heavier
OL,16,Frain passes through in the early
OL,17,Fhours, followed by clearer spells with
OL,18,Fisolated showers. Strong and gusty
OL,19,Fwinds throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
