OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA brighter day with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells, these mixed with
OL,7,Foccasional blustery showers, some of
OL,8,Fwhich could be heavy. Strong winds
OL,9,Feasing a little later in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells Wednesday, with occasional
OL,13,Fshowers. Winds gradually easing. Fog
OL,14,Fpatches possible Thursday and Friday
OL,15,Fmornings, with sunny spells later.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
